<title>SINGAPORE: Tiger Medical gets out of China venture.</title>
<headline>Tiger Medical gets out of China venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tiger Medicals Ltd said on Wednesday it has sold its 51 percent stake in Shanghai Huanghe DHA Pharmaceuticals Co Ltd to Shanghai Jiufu Pharmaceuticals Co.</p>
<p>The stake was sold for US$4.56 million cash and has resulted in an extraordinary gain of about S$250,000 for the group, a company statement said.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
